ass="aq-train-strip__mkn" x="1290" y="314">07</text></g></svg></div><ol class="aq-train-strip__stages" role="list"><li class="aq-train-strip__stage" data-ts="gen"><span class="aq-train-strip__glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false"><path class="aq-train-strip__eq" d="M4 10h24v12H4Z"/><path class="aq-train-strip__ln" d="M4 22L28 10"/></svg></span><span class="aq-train-strip__no" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3 class="aq-train-strip__t">Generation</h3><p class="aq-train-strip__d">Polyvinyl chloride (PVC) pretreatment, then RO. Electrodeionization (EDI) only where your grade needs it. Duplicate RO trains are often specified.</p></li><li class="aq-train-strip__stage" data-ts="tank"><span class="aq-train-strip__glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false"><path class="aq-train-strip__eq" d="M8 28V9q0-6 8-6t8 6v19Z"/><path class="aq-train-strip__level" d="M10 14h12"/></svg></span><span class="aq-train-strip__no" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3 class="aq-train-strip__t">Storage</h3><p class="aq-train-strip__d">Sized to the peak draw, such as washers filling together, so generation runs steady.</p></li><li class="aq-train-strip__stage" data-ts="pump"><span class="aq-train-strip__glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false"><circle class="aq-train-strip__eq" cx="16" cy="16" r="11"/><path class="aq-train-strip__ln" d="M12 9.5L23 16L12 22.5Z"/></svg></span><span class="aq-train-strip__no" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3 class="aq-train-strip__t">Loop pump and UV</h3><p class="aq-train-strip__d">Pumps: <span class="aq-ph">[duty and standby pumps, standard or option]</span>. 254 nm ultraviolet (UV) on the supply lowers the viable count; it does not sanitize the loop.</p></li><li class="aq-train-strip__stage" data-ts="hx"><span class="aq-train-strip__glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false"><circle class="aq-train-strip__eq" cx="16" cy="16" r="11"/><path class="aq-train-strip__ln" d="M6 16l3-5 4 10 4-10 4 10 3-5"/></svg></span><span class="aq-train-strip__no" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3 class="aq-train-strip__t">Temperature</h3><p class="aq-train-strip__d">Natural PP is rated 0 to 80 °C, and its pressure rating falls as it heats. Routine 80 °C at loop pressure, a hot-held loop or steam needs a polyvinylidene fluoride (PVDF) or stainless loop <span class="aq-ph">[whether we quote PVDF]</span>.</p></li><li class="aq-train-strip__stage" data-ts="pou"><span class="aq-train-strip__glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false"><path class="aq-train-strip__eq" d="M8 8H24L8 24H24Z"/><path class="aq-train-strip__ln" d="M24 11a5 5 0 0 1 0 10"/></svg></span><span class="aq-train-strip__no" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3 class="aq-train-strip__t">Points of use</h3><p class="aq-train-strip__d">Washers, sinks and bench taps on short branches; sections isolate for work. Endotoxin filtration: <span class="aq-ph">[endotoxin filter on the loop, standard or option]</span>.</p></li><li class="aq-train-strip__stage" data-ts="sensors"><span class="aq-train-strip__glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false"><circle class="aq-train-strip__eq" cx="16" cy="16" r="11"/><text class="aq-train-strip__ce" x="16" y="20">CE</text></svg></span><span class="aq-train-strip__no" aria-hidden="true">06</span><h3 class="aq-train-strip__t">Return sensors</h3><p class="aq-train-strip__d">Conductivity online after the last treatment step; samples at loop out, loop return and each outlet.</p></li><li class="aq-train-strip__stage" data-ts="spray"><span class="aq-train-strip__glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false"><path class="aq-train-strip__eq" d="M8 6H24L8 22H24Z"/><path class="aq-train-strip__ln" d="M24 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 10"/><path class="aq-train-strip__cap" d="M9 28h14"/></svg></span><span class="aq-train-strip__no" aria-hidden="true">07</span><h3 class="aq-train-strip__t">Sanitization</h3><p class="aq-train-strip__d"><span class="aq-ph">[PP loop sanitization method]</span>; residual tested before use. PVC stays upstream, out of the critical-water loop.</p></li></ol></div></div></section></div>
